pageType: final
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 120, 400, 16]
    content: {style: "$kicker", wrap: false, text: ALPHA-DESK TERMINAL}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 148, 848, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 30
      color: "$ink"
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 投研的每一步，都应该看得见、数得清
  - elementId: sub
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 210, 848, 28]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      wrap: false
      text: 专家团让观点有分歧、有理由；运行轨迹让 token 有账可查。
  - elementId: repo-panel
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 262, 420, 64]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$faint"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: repo
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 272, 392, 44]
    content:
      style: "$code"
      fontSize: 12
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$muted;"># 代码与文档</span></p>
        <p>github.com/JingHao-Leon/dsh-alpha-desk</p>
  - elementId: roadmap
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 352, 848, 60]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12.5
      lineHeight: 1.7
      text: |
        <p><strong>下一步</strong>：分时图（当日 tick 面积图）· 单命令启动脚本 · 配 key 后真实专家团月度复盘</p>
  - elementId: foot-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 460, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: foot
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 474, 848, 16]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: "本项目仅供学习研究，不构成投资建议 · 暂不执行真实交易 · 回测结果不代表未来收益"}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [870, 512, 34, 14]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, middle], wrap: false, text: "08"}
